[TITLE]
Selection-ops fixture #2 — every node and link KIND on one flow path.

Topology (flow left to right; DV1 has two outflow links so the divider is legal):

    S1          S2 <- S3             S4
     |           |                    |
     v           v                    v
    J1 --C1--> J2 --OR1--> ST1 --W1--> DV1 --OT1--> J3 --P1--> O1
                                        \----C2----^

  Nodes ....... J1 J2 J3 (junctions), ST1 (storage), DV1 (divider), O1 (outfall)
  Links ....... C1 C2 (conduits), OR1 (orifice), W1 (weir), OT1 (outlet), P1 (pump)
  Subcatch .... S1 -> J1, S2 -> ST1, S3 -> S2 (subcatchment outlet), S4 -> DV1

An upstream trace from O1 must visit ALL six nodes, ALL six links and ALL four
subcatchments — this is the fixture behind traceTraversesEveryNodeAndLinkKind,
which pins the requirement that Select Upstream/Downstream traverse every SWMM
node type (junction / storage / divider / outfall) and every link type
(conduit / orifice / weir / outlet / pump).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS       CFS
INFILTRATION     HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING     DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS     DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE        0
START_DATE       01/01/2026
START_TIME       00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE 01/01/2026
REPORT_START_TIME 00:00:00
END_DATE         01/01/2026
END_TIME         02:00:00
REPORT_STEP      00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP     00:00:30

[MAP]
DIMENSIONS -1000.000 -1000.000 6000.000 2000.000
Units      Feet

